  "notes": [
    "DRAFT: a skeleton from the world database export of map 329 (tools/dungeongen, spec tools/dungeongen/plans.json), hand-written since 2026-10-24 (census below). Walls, doors, stairs and events are unknown to it. Not mapped, not live-checked: do the GM-invisible mapping walk and correct the route before the first run (AUTO-IMPROVE step 0); dungeon_run refuses it without allow_draft.",
    "Census 2026-10-24 (487 spawns on map 329; world base + core scripts): the Spectral/Ghostly Citizens (10384/10385) are faction 7 = neutral (faction_template masks 0) and are out of every pull; Hearthsinger Forresten (10558, neutral rare) stays in the legs' skip lists; Skul (10393) and Stonespine (10809), both hostile rank-2 rares, are members of the packs they stand in (their spawns are 1.4-2.7 yd from a pack member) and are kill_first.",
    "No trash entry of this side flees: creature_ai_events has no FLEE action (command 47) for any of 10381 10382 10390 10391 10398 10399 10400 10405 10406 10407 10408 10409 10411 10412 10413 10414 10416 10417 10463 10464 10393 10809. The undead are type 6 (no_cc: a Polymorph does not land); only 10398/10399/10400 are humanoid (type 7) and no pack needs one.",
    "Ash'ari Crystals 10415 are NOT pulls: the crystal suicides once the Thuzadin Acolytes within 50 yd of it are dead (mobs_cristal_zuggurat; that grid search is 2-D, so each crystal sees its own five acolytes 1-9 yd away), and the plan kills all 15 acolytes at the three ziggurats. The crystal stands 47-51 yd above the acolytes' floor and the navmesh has no polygon at its x,y (probe: Floors and Nearest find nothing within 20 yd), so a pull could not be walked. Killing all three opens the gauntlet and Slaughter Square ports (TYPE_CRISTAL_DIE -\u003e StartSlaugtherSquare).",
    "Baron Rivendare is UNIT_FLAG_NOT_SELECTABLE|SPAWNING until the Slaughter Square event: aggro any of the 13 Bile Spewers/Venom Belchers (the last leg's pulls), kill them all, and Ramstein the Gorger (10439, no spawn row) is summoned at 4032.35 -3380.57 and the Baron becomes selectable. The rows cannot name Ramstein or the five Black Guards (10394) the event spawns; the party fights them where they stand.",
    "The 45-minute Baron run starts only from Ysida's Cage (181071); the plan has no use_object step, so the party does not free her and no timer runs.",
    "Doors are script state, not rows: Service Entrance 175368, Gauntlet Gate 175357, Slaughter Square Gate 175358 (opens on Ramstein's death), Ziggurat doors 175379/175380/175381 (open on Nerub'enkan's, Anastari's and Maleki's deaths) and the ports 175373/175374 (crystals). The bots walk through a closed door (the SM wings' and the live side's runs did), so none is a row.",
    "Patrols: 23 of the map's 36 movement-type-2 spawns stand within 25 yd of a plan point (the three Eyes of Naxxramas 10411, the Patchwork Horrors 10414, the gargoyles 10408/10409, the plague ghouls 10405, Stonespine 10809); the plan carries no patrol block, so a single-unit pull of one is found where it stands, and one that walks into a fight is not in the rows.",
    "The north-west street past 0.14 (3574 -3346) leaves six hostiles of the next block (3535-3545 -3340..-3356: 10390/10391/10381, 20.6-25.7 yd from the nearest plan point) outside the pulls: within aggro + 5 yd, so a pull that drifts or a knockback can add them; the mapping walk picks the stands.",
    "Adds with no spawn row: Ravaged Cadaver 10381 summons a Broken Cadaver on death, Thuzadin Necromancer 10400 a Skeletal Servant (12420) on spawn, Eye of Naxxramas 10411 gargoyles on aggro, the abominations' event Ramstein and the Black Guards.",
    "Back entrance (2214) of map 329; the live side is stratholme_live (its bosses are another migration on the same map)."
  ],
