        "door \"King's Square Gate\" entry 175353 at 3555.8 -3434.9 136.4",
        "door \"Service Entrance Gate\" entry 175368 at 3624.9 -3642.2 138.4",
        "The pulls run entrance -\u003e King's Square (0.1) -\u003e the Gauntlet corner (0.2, 0.3) -\u003e the east hall (0.4, 0.5) -\u003e Elders' Square west (0.6, 0.7) -\u003e the street packs (0.8-0.11) -\u003e the north street (0.12, 0.13) -\u003e back east (0.14, 0.15), 207 yd shorter than the draft's walk from the north street to the east hall and back to the boss. The exporter writes a leg's boss last, so Barthilas is the leg's last step; his spawn is 20.4 yd from the first pack (detection 20, just outside it), so a fight at 0.1 that drifts may bring him.",
        "The 20-unit pack the draft had at 3614 -3483 is four pulls by formation: the 7-unit street pack (with Skul and the Eye of Naxxramas), the 6-unit mid pack, the 3-unit formation at 3629 -3495 and the three plague ghouls at 3643 -3475. The Patchwork Horror's pull is merged into the 7-unit pack 6.7 yd from it.",
        "The single cadaver pull at 3550 -3422 was half of a 7-member formation the spec's bbox cut (x below 3550): the pull is the whole formation plus the two plague ghouls standing in it, 9 units."
      ]
